{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026jGyzgYS2Tu1793200842.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>在巴西總統選舉中落敗，並拒絕承認結果的自由黨候選人弗拉維奧抵達美國。</p><p></p><p>巴西最高法院在選舉結束後裁定，禁止弗拉維奧離境，並要求他就競選期間，涉嫌收受外國資金和操縱社交媒體一事接受調查。據報他未經正常出入境程序離開巴西，並在周三與家人抵達美國佛羅里達州。美聯社報道，總統特朗普政府向弗拉維奧和他的家人發放簽證，允許他們入境。</p><p></p><p>成功連任巴西總統的盧拉較早前批評弗拉維奧可恥，巴西只是他整個家族的第二個家，美國才是他們的真正故鄉。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.US.BRAZIL-2300_003.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026Ngx7OzSNhJ1793200890.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T15:58:13.771083+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":211,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T15:17:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T12:38:14.759224+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T15:55:40.094467+00:00","content_hash":"6adb15b22a8ab8dcda9ab168817dd11aee6025f0aab3c577d669bed5d63bbc25","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-28T15:58:13.771083+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}